{
  "prompt": "How does this paper define its five levels of autonomy? Are the levels defined by what the AI can do, or by the role the human user plays (operator, collaborator, consultant, approver, observer)? Summarize each level in one line, and note the authors' argument about autonomy being a design choice separate from capability. Also note any table or figure format they use.",
