}

{
  "prompt": "Summarize DeepMind's \"Levels of AGI\" autonomy levels (AI as a tool, consultant, collaborator, expert, agent) and the point about pairing each autonomy level with example risks. Also any point that autonomy is a deployment choice separate from capability.",
